OL,3,GNEWSAMan found not guilty of sex
OL,4,Aoffences on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found not guilty of a
OL,7,Fnumber of sexual offences against a
OL,8,Fwoman on an East Sussex beach.
OL,10,FMohammed Maatoug, 34, of Boxley Road,
OL,11,FMaidstone, Kent, was arrested after a
OL,12,Fwoman in her 50s reported being
OL,13,Fattacked on 25 August 2025 while she
OL,14,Fwas sunbathing in the dunes at Camber
OL,15,FSands.
OL,17,FHe was found not guilty of two counts
OL,18,Fof sexual assault on a female and on
OL,19,Fone count of assault on a female aged
OL,20,F13 and over by penetration.
